     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\">Hi Stan,</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial\">    I am working on a large-scale\r\ndata analysis. The sample size is 100,000, and the number of parameters is\r\naround 100,000. I submitted a task for three chains with 2000 iterations per\r\nchain. This task was run by cloud computing; I set the required memory to be\r\n35,000 Megabytes.  But I got the following error report at the end of my\r\nsimulation:</span></p><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0);min-height:15px\"><span></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Chain 3, Iteration: 2000 / 2000 [100%]  (Sampling)one iteration:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0);min-height:15px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0);min-height:15px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0);min-height:15px\"><span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Elapsed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Time</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">68671</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seconds </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Warm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">up</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#000\">               </span><span style=\"color:#066\">63771.7</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seconds </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sampling</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#000\">               </span><span style=\"color:#066\">132443</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seconds </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Total</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0);min-height:15px\"><span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sendMaster</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">try</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">eval</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">expr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> env</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> silent </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">long</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> vectors </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> supported yet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fork</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">378</span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#606\">Calls</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Anonymous</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lapply </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FUN </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mcparallel </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sendMaster</span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FUN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#000\">  trying to </span><span style=\"color:#008\">get</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> slot </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;mode&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> an </span><span style=\"color:#008\">object</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">class</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;try-error&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> that </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> an S4 </span><span style=\"color:#008\">object</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#606\">Calls</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stan </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sampling </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sampling </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">local</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sapply </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lapply </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FUN</span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> parallel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mclapply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">chains</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FUN </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> callFun</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">preschedule </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> calls resulted </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> an error</span></span></p><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><p style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"color:#606\">Execution</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> halted</span></span></p></div></code></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:#222222\">This looks like some memory issue. I don&#39;t\r\nknow how to fix that. Would any of you give me some suggestions?  This is\r\nthe google drive link of my code and data\r\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B6JWm4Lssl1xZnhYVmcwMEYtQ0k\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://drive.google.com/open?id%3D0B6JWm4Lssl1xZnhYVmcwMEYtQ0k&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457754547000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0_m0UOVdt9gOQ25zPdWyAa\">https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B6JWm4Lssl1xZnhYVmcwMEYtQ0k</a>. Thank you very\r\nmuch! </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:#222222\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:#222222\">Best wishes,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:#222222\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:#222222\">Lu Zhang</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial\"><br></span></p></div>"
